es Task responsibility for individual task state while TaskList owns collection mutation and display operations.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":42,"deletions":66}}},{"hash":"52164cb7a66e4d3dd8112d8d45cf02034f5d93ad","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task command parsing into Parser","messageBody":"Move interpretation of todo, deadline, and event commands out of Task and into a dedicated Parser. Keep Task focused on individual task state and persistence formatting while AllMind delegates task creation to Parser.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":56,"deletions":46}}},{"hash":"50d267223a43ac7d1eb234fc9094d41fd2a6cad5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move task file format handling into Parser","messageBody":"Move task serialization, deserialization, escaping, unescaping, and storage date conversion out of Task and into Parser. Update Storage to use Parser for file records, leaving Task focused on individual task state and display behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":86,"deletions":154}}},{"hash":"b7e0d3a59b5f317857c667d748d8576fb87b0fb3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e39d49c75c7a2044037d40d9735d4d4133ebb505","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Organise classes into packages","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":63,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"ba63aa5db6236f0c7728dcf8d4b82e7dbb525754","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-Packages\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Packages"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e3eb35c72b8a430d909a17eb90cfc55e3142e3d6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027origin/add-gradle-support\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Gradle"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"90b46c300bd7d5183d73a06b046cfba5fd12fba3","isMergeCommit